    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Parenteral bactericidal beta-lactam. Cross-allergy unlikely except with ceftazidime/cefiderocol (shared R1 side chain), so used for serious gram-negative infections in patients with serious beta-lactam allergy."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
